  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">尋找Forge版本？點此取得！</a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SiO5ANY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"439\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?color=blueviolet&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=blueviolet&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"187\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LunaPixelStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=LunaPixelStudios&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"172\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?color=blue&amp;label=Follow&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"127\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FORGE-Version-black?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"137\" height=\"26\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沒錯！雲端之上的村莊！探索天空中美麗的龐大村莊！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些村莊會在你的世界中完全隨機生成，每座天空城鎮都有獨特且與眾不同的外觀！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組目前穩定開發中。每次更新都會加入新的村莊/內容。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric)</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>相容性資料包</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">資料包讓你能以特定方式修改此模組。一切皆可更改與配置。相容資料包會將其他模組的方塊、物品和生物加入其中。若要將它們加入你的模組包，請包含 Global Packs 模組，並將它們放入你的 resourcepacks 資料夾。此外，你也可以使用 Paxi 或 Open Loader 確保它們在世界創建時載入。如果你使用 Curseforge 啟動器，請考慮將相容資料包放入 resourcepacks 資料夾，以便 Curseforge 正確識別它們。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前提供以下官方相容資料包（版本 v1.0.4）：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-waystones-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-graveyard-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Graveyard x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-supplementaries-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-farmers-delight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-bakery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Bakery x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-vinery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Vinery x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-candlelight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Candlelight x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-beachparty-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Beachparty x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-brewery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Brewery x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-herbal-brews-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Herbal Brews x Sky Villages</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/LunaPixel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ls7ak2O.png\" width=\"1076\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>圖片</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s47MBTf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KzcpaYS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aRlKszu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G4BOAHE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EmGry5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/We7fyp4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"></strong></span></p>",
